   "text": "## Architecture\n\nThe system has two components. The first stores media.\n\n### Components\n\n- The Cache keeps hot items.\n- The Store persists all items.\n\n### Interfaces\n\n| Name        | Provider   |\n|-------------|------------|\n| IMediaStore | Store      |\n\nClients use the interface. It is stable."
